WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.598
<v NARRATOR>You're standing in the team house, and you already know what's happening tomorrow night.

00:00:04.598 --> 00:00:10.033
<v NARRATOR>The captains have planned a rookie initiation — freshmen chugging mystery mixes until someone throws up.

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:13.116
<v NARRATOR>You did this last year, back when you were Dana's roommate.

00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:14.422
<v NARRATOR>You remember how it felt.

00:00:14.422 --> 00:00:18.759
<v NARRATOR>And you know one freshman on the roster has a heart condition he never talks about.
